# A corsair. 32x32, content rows 4..31, soles on row 31.
#
# Built through the pipeline rather than by eye, which is the whole point of
# this experiment:
#
#   describe-image   -> the source is 32x32 in 20x20 blocks, 15 colours,
#                       content 15x28, soles on the last row
#   extract-palette  -> palette.gpl beside this file, measured not invented
#   conform-sprite   -> onto that palette at 32x32 (84 px move to the shared
#                       outline spine, the one deliberate repaint)
#   trace-pix        -> this grid
#
# Two earlier versions were drawn freehand from a mental image of the source.
# Both passed every gate in the repo and both were wrong on canvas size,
# proportion, colour count and footing -- see ../README.md. Nothing here is
# clever; it is just measured.
name corsair
size 32 32
key c crimson-0-shadow
key C crimson-2-hilite
key g gold
key r crimson-1
key l leather-1
key b bone-2-hilite
key o outline
key B blush
key s skin
key L leather-0-shadow
key d denim-0-shadow
key D denim-1
key h denim-2-hilite
key S steel
key O bone-1
pixels
*4 ................................
..................ccccc.........
................ccCCgCCc........
...............cCCrlgbrc........
..............cCrrooooooo.......
.............cCroooooooooo......
............crrooooooooooo......
............crrooBbbBbboo.......
............BsooBBbosob.........
...........BLsooBsbosobsL.......
...........BLBooossBBsssL.......
............BBBossooLBBBL.......
............ooBBBooooooooo......
.............ooBBssoooooo.......
..............oLBBBBBBBL........
.............dDcrrccLLL.........
............dhcCCcrLbbbL........
............dcrCCCLbbbbbL.......
...........dhcrrCCLbbbbbL.......
...........dhocrrCrLbbbL........
...........doobcrrccLLLd........
...........doSbbcccbbbDd........
............dSbSbDDhhhbd........
............dSOSdbbbbbd.........
.............SOScdddddc.........
..............Sccccccc..........
...............LLLLLoLo.........
...............oLLLLgogo........
...............ooooooooo........
